  "configuration_id": "config_013",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile avgpool with scvi_n200 is strong, but image-only evidence is sparse: only ResNet50 singleprofile was tested and performed poorly. This experiment tests whether a stronger ImageNet ViT-L image encoder yields useful image-only signal, isolating representation while keeping the profile setting fixed. It is the best next use of budget because it reduces uncertainty about whether the image modality is worth pursuing before multimodal fusion, avoids confounding encoder, profile, and fusion changes, and will guide whether remaining experiments should target image/multimodal settings or focus on RNA."
}

